 * Pin 15 CS\     SSEL (pulled high)   PORT3 Pin 6  P1.8  GPIO
 *                                                  (Also RMII_CRS_DV)
 * Pin 16 DCLK    SCK                  PORT3 Pin 5  P1.19 SCK1
 * -------------- -------------------- ------------ -------------------------
 */

